{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:mapping-cone","title":"def:mapping-cone","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.md","line":350,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex#def:mapping-cone","uses":["[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:cone]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:attaching-space]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","label":"def:mapping-cone","line":479,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Mapping cone]\n\\label{def:mapping-cone}\n\n\\uses{def:cone, def:attaching-space}\n\\group{Homotopy Theory}\n\nFor $f:X\\to Y$, the \\textbf{mapping cone} is\n$C_f=Y\\sqcup_f CX$, attaching $X\\times\\{1\\}$ to $Y$ by $f$. If\n$X=S^{n-1}$, this attaches an $n$-cell to $Y$; also $C_f=M_f/X$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Mapping cone] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6d617070696e672d636f6e65\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter0%23def%3Acone\">↗ def:cone</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter0%23def%3Aattaching-space\">↗ def:attaching-space</a> \\group Homotopy Theory <p></p>For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:X\\to Y$\">$f:X\\to Y$</span>, the <strong>mapping cone</strong> is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$C_f=Y\\sqcup _f CX$\">$C_f=Y\\sqcup _f CX$</span>, attaching <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X\\times \\{ 1\\} $\">$X\\times \\{ 1\\} $</span> to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y$\">$Y$</span> by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f$\">$f$</span>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X=S^{n-1}$\">$X=S^{n-1}$</span>, this attaches an <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>-cell to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y$\">$Y$</span>; also <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$C_f=M_f/X$\">$C_f=M_f/X$</span>. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:attaching-space","next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:attaching-homotopic-maps-preview","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:cone","title":"def:cone","label":"def:cone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:attaching-space","title":"def:attaching-space","label":"def:attaching-space"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#ex:quotient-contractible-subcomplex-mapping-cone","title":"ex:quotient-contractible-subcomplex-mapping-cone","label":"ex:quotient-contractible-subcomplex-mapping-cone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#ex:sphere-two-points-identified-via-attaching","title":"ex:sphere-two-points-identified-via-attaching","label":"ex:sphere-two-points-identified-via-attaching"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:mapping-cone","title":"def:mapping-cone","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Mapping cone]\n\\label{def:mapping-cone}\n\n\\uses{def:cone, def:attaching-space}\n\\group{Homotopy Theory}\n\nFor $f:X\\to Y$, the \\textbf{mapping cone} is\n$C_f=Y\\sqcup_f CX$, attaching $X\\times\\{1\\}$ to $Y$ by $f$. If\n$X=S^{n-1}$, this attaches an $n$-cell to $Y$; also $C_f=M_f/X$.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Hatche